nodes.body:
Rebased on main 410ab341a8 (head bbae878ed8, includes #63892), review comments addressed above.

Re-ran on 4x MI355X:
- tests/models/test_dsv41_mono_{numerics,layers,decode}.py: TP4 85 passed / 5 skipped, TP2 83 passed / 7 skipped (same counts as main);
- 115/115 cases bit-identical to main at TP2 (92 on tuned builds), 16/16 at TP4;
- MLIR of all non-tuned builds byte-identical to main (gfx950 384/384, gfx942 TP4 76/76);
- ratio-2 K1+K2 microbench: -8.7% to -17.2% for M = 1..48, weighted -10.8% (c32) / -11.5% (c4).

Not run here: TP8 and gfx942 on hardware; those cases are skipped, TP8 and gfx942 TP4 were checked at the MLIR level only.

